Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=10}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.77,0:01:59.77,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,Brother, it's hard to dig!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.77,0:02:01.01,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,{That's because this island is made mostly out of tree roots. - OG}Of course it is!{Gab, split for the infobox}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.01,0:02:03.21,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,{That's because this island is made mostly out of tree roots. - OG}The island is made mostly out of tree roots.{Gab, small cps fix}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.71,0:02:07.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please forgive us, don't bury us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.31,0:02:09.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything, just don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.85,0:02:13.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The captain, Black, forced us to do it! - OG}Captain Black forced us to do it!{Gab}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.19,0:02:18.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once we joined them, we thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.92,0:02:23.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we could kill the Straw Hats...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.86,0:02:26.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with high bounties...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.17,0:02:33.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,easily from within, as we like!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.11,0:02:37.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drip!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.74,0:02:39.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop! He's gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.91,0:02:42.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you a devil fruit eater?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.11,0:02:44.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D-Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.62,0:02:47.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes! I got him...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.82,0:02:53.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's going on here? A logia?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.23,0:02:57.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But, look what happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.90,0:03:03.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought he just looked different\Nbecause I hadn't seen him for two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.23,0:03:05.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The pirate Straw Hat...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.10,0:03:06.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No wonder!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.90,0:03:09.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was just a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.01,0:03:12.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you think the gods\Nwill forgive them, Coribou?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.31,0:03:13.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dig! I dig!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.81,0:03:15.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.21,0:03:17.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's bury them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.01,0:03:19.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh gods!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.45,0:03:23.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let us bury these fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.49,0:03:27.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't! Please don't kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.19,0:03:33.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I saw the real Straw Hat Luffy for myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.57,0:03:39.64,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,I told you that I had no choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.34,0:03:43.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dark King Rayleigh stood in our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.21,0:03:45.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He could even fight Uncle Kizaru equally!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.34,0:03:47.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What would you expect us to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.95,0:03:54.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Caribou brothers and their crew\Nand some of the fake Straw Hats...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.38,0:03:55.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,got away successfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.65,0:04:02.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}We caught all the others but two pacifista\Nwere severely damaged by the real Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.86,0:04:06.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One of them was the prototype\Nthat cornered the Straw Hats two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.73,0:04:09.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course, his strength hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.47,0:04:11.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So they must have gotten stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:16.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They've improved themselves\Nin last two years, big time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:22.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make sure to tell\NMarine Headquarters in the New World.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.15,0:04:27.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats are completely revived!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.09,0:04:33.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're gone before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.26,0:04:42.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Monkey-chan and everybody, they all got stronger. - OG}Our little Monkey and everybody,\Nthey all got stronger.{Gab, "monkey-chan" localization from RtS 02 - 30:32}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.57,0:04:44.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Were you watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.80,0:04:46.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm a fan of theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.67,0:04:52.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're thinking about something,\Naren't you, Ray{-san}?{no "Ray-san"s in modern subs so not doing a specific localization - Gab}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.31,0:04:54.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.45,0:04:57.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.55,0:05:04.69,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's a nice ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.69,0:05:06.42,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I stole it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.42,0:05:08.76,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,My house burned down so I'm living here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.76,0:05:11.26,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah? And what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.26,0:05:12.40,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:15.00,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:18.07,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I think we were destined to meet, Rayleigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.07,0:05:19.77,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Destined?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.77,0:05:23.21,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna turn the world\Nupside down with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.64,0:05:24.71,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.71,0:05:26.18,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,The world?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.21,0:05:29.18,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are you and where you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.65,0:05:31.01,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.88,0:05:36.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe nothing in this world\Nhappens by accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.02,0:05:39.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As everything happens for a reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.42,0:05:43.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,our destiny slowly takes form.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:46.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At any rate, Luffy looks great in that hat,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.90,0:05:50.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,better than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.30,0:05:54.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe I want to live a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.67,0:05:58.11,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,The surface is far up there already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.11,0:05:59.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a view!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.91,0:06:03.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Submarines can't have windows this wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.71,0:06:06.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're sinking and sinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.62,0:06:09.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't stop worrying about flooding!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:13.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Feels like we're leaving the inhabited\Nworld. It makes me nervous!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.29,0:06:18.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C-C-Can we go back\Non the surface again for sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.13,0:06:21.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-It's not like I'm scared but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.63,0:06:26.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.34,0:06:36.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.35,0:06:41.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trees... No, roots!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.52,0:06:46.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.19,0:06:50.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, Sabaody Archipelago\Nconsists of giant mangroves!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.66,0:06:53.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm overwhelmed by the beauty of nature!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.50,0:06:56.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I'm so surprised - my eyes could pop out! - OG}I'm so surprised that my eyes could pop out!{Gab}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:57.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I don't have eyes though! - OG}Oh, but I don't have eyes.{Gab}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.07,0:07:01.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've seen this already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.14,0:07:03.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, because you got on the wrong ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.11,0:07:05.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Everybody's having a great time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.18,0:07:09.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe these roots\Nare running down to the sea bottom!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.61,0:07:13.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're enormous and magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.49,0:07:21.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't hold it any longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.16,0:07:22.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.63,0:07:24.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something behind that tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.66,0:07:25.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.46,0:07:29.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.37,0:07:31.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.34,0:07:33.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An underwater adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.20,0:07:34.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's like a dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.94,0:07:37.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:38.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think I can catch them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:42.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The fish here look delicious too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.15,0:07:46.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it, you fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.12,0:07:48.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What if the bubble pops!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.89,0:07:50.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't ever do that again or I kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.85,0:07:56.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Nami{-san}, give us some dos and don'ts on\Nthe coated ship before they do something stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.89,0:07:58.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, Sanji{-kun}!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.76,0:08:01.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh{-san} gave me a note.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.13,0:08:03.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, everyone, listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.20,0:08:04.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.57,0:08:06.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A real, beautiful woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.30,0:08:07.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Sanji!\N– Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.87,0:08:09.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's gonna pop! It's gonna pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.27,0:08:11.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How can you fly that far with nosebleed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.88,0:08:15.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?!\N– What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.31,0:08:17.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Sanji flew out into the water!\N– Sanji flew out into the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:18.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.72,0:08:26.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The bubble doesn't break even under\Ntremendous pressure in this deep water
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.59,0:08:30.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but things can pass through it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.33,0:08:32.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.90,0:08:35.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.97,0:08:38.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I feel weak in the water...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.17,0:08:41.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Hang in there!\N– Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.58,0:08:55.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened to you, Sanji?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.75,0:08:58.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've become even more\Nsusceptible to women!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.99,0:09:00.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This isn't like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.42,0:09:01.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for him...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.39,0:09:06.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{What happened to this ladies' man Sanji-san in the past 2 years? - OG}What happened to Sanji the ladies' man\Nin the past two years?{Gab}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.30,0:09:13.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}At this rate, he's gonna bleed to death once\Nhe meets the mermaids that he's longing to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.90,0:09:16.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't help worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.57,0:09:19.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll have to call for blood\Ndonations at Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.94,0:09:24.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder if fishmen and mermaids\Nhave the same blood as humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.21,0:09:28.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The bubble that coats the {\i1}Sunny{\i0}\Nhas the same quality...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.52,0:09:33.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{as the bubbles at Sabaody Archipelago as we just saw. - OG}as the bubbles we just saw\Nat Sabaody Archipelago.{Gab, line break}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.66,0:09:36.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop analyzing the bubble\Nin such a calm manner!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.69,0:09:38.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, Robin's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.23,0:09:41.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Basically, they're the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:46.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It stretches to a certain point and\Nbeyond that, it allows things to get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.27,0:09:51.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\t(0,383,1,\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}Which means if we fire a gun or a cannon\Nat a creature that attacks us,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.24,0:09:52.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the bubble won't break.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.88,0:09:53.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.08,0:09:57.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, on what occasion will it break instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.61,0:10:02.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As you can imagine, when there are\Ntoo many holes at once, it'll break.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.15,0:10:07.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For example, if we are bitten\Nby a sea king's fangs, it'll be trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.23,0:10:13.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,548)}– It's coming from behind!\N– It's coming from behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.73,0:10:15.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're fighting... We're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.00,0:10:21.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or if the ship itself breaks up\Nby crashing into a rock or a trench,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.14,0:10:27.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the broken mast or planking will break\Nthe bubble and that also spells danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.14,0:10:30.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So we have to be careful\Nwith creatures and obstacles in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.78,0:10:33.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as we don't do anything\Nfoolish from inside, it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.62,0:10:37.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see! It's tougher than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.12,0:10:39.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.22,0:10:43.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{70% of ships that head for the Fishman Island... - OG}of the ships that head\Nfor Fishman Island, 70% of them...{Gab, no numeral at start}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.19,0:10:46.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,end up sinking. So be cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.20,0:10:49.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What's gonna happen?!\N– What's gonna happen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.67,0:10:54.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With my Gatling, I can catch\Na whole school of fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.30,0:10:57.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then let's see which of us can catch more fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.41,0:11:02.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weren't you guys listening\Nto what Nami said?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.41,0:11:04.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Too many holes" is no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.71,0:11:08.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't ever try it again or I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.12,0:11:09.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.39,0:11:15.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Hachi said he'd show us the way to Fishman Island\Nso I thought it was gonna be a safe trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.93,0:11:16.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.76,0:11:19.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They gave me a lot of lunches!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.90,0:11:22.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since Sanji is sick, let's eat these, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.80,0:11:25.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so starved!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.57,0:11:28.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My bones are starved!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.71,0:11:32.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, the ship is gonna be stable for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.71,0:11:35.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't we have to do anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:36.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.25,0:11:39.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We just have to ride\Nthis big sea current for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.98,0:11:43.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, yeah, we can continue on\Nlike this for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.35,0:11:46.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't have much to do until later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.52,0:11:49.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then we have a little time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.76,0:11:54.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something that\NI have to tell you all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.43,0:11:56.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– The robot's secrets?!\N– The robot's secrets?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.63,0:11:59.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have more secrets?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.10,0:12:01.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What can you transform into?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.00,0:12:03.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or you have a secret weapon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.41,0:12:05.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell us, robot brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.44,0:12:09.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std E Strp\fs95\c&H2C3AA7&\fad(150,150)}Super {\c&H9797D4&\alpha&HFF&}Armor{\c&HC2B698&}ed {\c&HE1D672&}Me!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.98,0:12:09.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std E Strp\fs95\c&H2C3AA7&\fad(150,150)\alpha&HFF&}Super {\c&H9797D4&\alpha&H00&\4a&H78&}Armor{\c&HC2B698&}ed {\c&HE1D672&\alpha&HFF&}Me!
Dialogue: 2,0:12:08.31,0:12:09.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std E Strp\fs95\c&H2C3AA7&\fad(150,150)\alpha&HFF&}Super {\c&H9797D4&}Armor{\c&HC2B698&}ed {\c&HE1D672&\alpha&H00&\4a&H78&}Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.68,0:12:16.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, I'm afraid...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.92,0:12:18.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std E Strp\b1}I'm afraid it's not about that-robo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.96,0:12:21.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Wow, cool! He speaks Robotese!\N– Wow, cool! He speaks Robotese!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.29,0:12:26.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is what I wanna tell you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.76,0:12:29.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and eat while you're listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.63,0:12:34.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hachi told us that he would show us\Nthe way to Fishman Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:40.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}but he got severely injured at Sabaody\Nand he's under medical care at Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.31,0:12:43.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He got injured for the same reason as Duval.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.21,0:12:48.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He had been protecting the {\i1}Thousand Sunny{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.79,0:12:54.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Around a year ago, the Marines found out about\Nthe {\i1}Sunny{\i0} and those two both faced fierce battles
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.12,0:12:56.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and were taken out of commission.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.53,0:12:57.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.59,0:13:01.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then how did the ship\Nremain undamaged after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.67,0:13:04.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There was someone else who fought for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.47,0:13:06.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There was someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.87,0:13:12.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's the one who separated us two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.58,0:13:18.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(3350,0,1,\c&H000000&)}The big Warlord: Bartholomew Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.82,0:13:25.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe my eyes\Nwhen I got to the {\i1}Sunny{\i0} a few days ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.29,0:13:31.83,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.43,0:13:35.50,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.73,0:13:38.80,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Mission accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.59,0:13:58.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There isn't even a scratch on the {\i1}Sunny{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.46,0:14:02.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And Rayleigh told me later...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.73,0:14:05.73,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I work for the Revolutionary Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.73,0:14:09.27,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Since I have a connection with them,\NI wanna let them get away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.63,0:14:13.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think you guys half expected that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:16.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He saved our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.54,0:14:21.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And after we vanished from the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.51,0:14:25.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuma{-san} visited Rayleigh and told him...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.25,0:14:26.92,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\t(0,515,1,\3c&H525252&\4c&H000000&)}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.02,0:14:29.69,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,don't have much time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.02,0:14:34.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know what made him obey the Marines,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.22,0:14:39.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}but he agreed to be a guinea pig and let his body\Nbe modified into a cyborg piece by piece
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.76,0:14:45.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and he somehow lost his personality\Nbefore the Summit War.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:52.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I don't think he could guess what\Neach of us would do after we get separated!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.78,0:14:56.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even so he waited for us\Nat the ship without his personality?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.51,0:15:00.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He made Dr. Vegapunk, who modified him...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.85,0:15:05.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,agree to program a mission into his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:11.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}"Defend the pirate ship until the day that\None of the Straw Hats comes back to the ship."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.36,0:15:15.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why, for the past two years,\Nwithout his own memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.47,0:15:21.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he had been carrying out his own orders,\Nas a human weapon, waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.01,0:15:25.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.64,0:15:27.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why did he do such a thing for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:30.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Terms like "connection," "Revolutionary Army,"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.28,0:15:35.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,remind me about Luffy's father,\Nthe leader of the Revolutionary Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.25,0:15:42.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know my father that well,\Nbut that bear-like guy was a good guy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.29,0:15:44.49,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuma...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.49,0:15:54.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There is no mistake that he's the one\Nwho gave us the past two worthwhile years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.24,0:16:01.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't even ask him\Nwhy he did it but just remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:08.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bartholomew Kuma turned out\Nto be one of our greatest allies.
Comment: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:05.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bartholomew Kuma turned out to be one of our greatest allies.
Comment: 0,0:16:05.82,0:16:08.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bartholomew Kuma turned out to be one of our greatest allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.38,0:16:12.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But even if we meet him again,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.56,0:16:15.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kuma is now a heartless human weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.19,0:16:17.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's all I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.69,0:16:20.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{I appreciate what he did but there are still some mysteries. - OG}I'm grateful, but I still have a lot of questions.{Viz (CPS)}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.43,0:16:23.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope we can find out his motive one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.43,0:16:24.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Ally"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.77,0:16:26.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, you woke up, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.84,0:16:29.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eat lunch! It's from the Isle of Women!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.57,0:16:31.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isle of Women?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.77,0:16:34.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that Kuma guy really an ally?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:37.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize where I was\Nfor the past two years?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.68,0:16:42.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What kind of training were you doing\Nat the dream island full of women, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.59,0:16:46.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Whoa, whoa, Sanji-san, I don't know what you've been through - OG}Now, now, Sanji. I don't know\Nwhat you've been through, but...{Gab}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.22,0:16:48.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop trying to cheer me up! I feel pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.96,0:16:52.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brother, there he is. Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.03,0:16:56.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can see that, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.67,0:17:00.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna join them this time for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.87,0:17:03.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How deeply are we submerged now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.27,0:17:07.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's getting darker and darker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.58,0:17:12.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We went through the euphotic zone\Nand we're at the bottom of the twilight zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.72,0:17:15.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It must be more than\Na thousand meters below.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:16.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's really quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.95,0:17:20.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It feels different from submersibles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.22,0:17:22.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It feels like flying in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.96,0:17:24.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whale! There is a whale!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.89,0:17:26.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Laboon! Laboon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.80,0:17:29.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, that's old man Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.97,0:17:35.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something\Nat six o'clock! Is it a creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.47,0:17:36.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.27,0:17:39.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you guys all ready?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.71,0:17:41.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.11,0:17:42.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes, yes!\N– Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.61,0:17:45.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The target is right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.35,0:17:51.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's easier to just destroy their ship\Nand let it be swallowed by the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.65,0:17:56.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but that's no good because\Nthey won't know who did it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.66,0:18:04.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}We gotta cut their heads off and bring them back\Nto show the world what Caribou is capable of!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.53,0:18:05.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes!\N– Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.90,0:18:08.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're not ready to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.37,0:18:10.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a complete surprise attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.14,0:18:12.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't make a mistake, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.88,0:18:14.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes!\N– Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.34,0:18:15.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.38,0:18:20.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys! There is a ship\Nkind of thing coming from behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.42,0:18:21.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.32,0:18:21.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.99,0:18:23.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's coming towards us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.92,0:18:25.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.46,0:18:34.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a pirate ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:36.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're pushing against us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.70,0:18:40.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go away! The bubble is gonna pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.41,0:18:49.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! They're gonna come through the bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.25,0:18:51.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.25,0:18:55.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.42,0:18:57.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hard to port!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.46,0:19:05.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, sea cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.67,0:19:10.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're coming after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.97,0:19:11.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{That sounds so familiar... - OG}That noise–{Gab, lit. "that voice/sound" (この声), unlocalized for cps}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.47,0:19:14.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're so persistent!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.77,0:19:17.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do they want from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.08,0:19:22.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.45,0:19:23.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The bubble is gonna pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.28,0:19:26.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're doing great, sea cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.15,0:19:27.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes!\N– Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.22,0:19:29.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are they gonna come aboard?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.52,0:19:29.59,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Sea cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.85,0:19:32.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute! That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.06,0:19:37.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The bubbles are joined!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.89,0:19:39.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brother, now is the chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.70,0:19:41.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.26,0:19:43.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Should we do it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.10,0:19:44.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes!\N– Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.33,0:19:45.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Momoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.97,0:19:48.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You're Momoo of the Arlong Pirates, aren't you? - OG}Aren't you Momoo of the Arlong Pirates?{Gab, little change for cps}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.27,0:19:50.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.97,0:19:52.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.34,0:19:54.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was there at the Arlong Park!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.28,0:19:57.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.75,0:19:59.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doesn't he look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.62,0:20:00.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.75,0:20:03.99,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\t(0,518,1,\3c&H525252&\4c&H000000&)}Die, damn you!{Arlong 02 - 10:21}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.99,0:20:06.76,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.56,0:20:11.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's board their ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.86,0:20:12.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes!\N– Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.10,0:20:16.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! He's coming through the bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.87,0:20:18.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, somebody's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.67,0:20:20.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.74,0:20:25.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.24,0:20:26.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.94,0:20:28.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes!\N– Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.75,0:20:36.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,While they're dumbfounded,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.05,0:20:39.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.29,0:20:42.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.13,0:20:45.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.16,0:20:48.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys, follow my lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.10,0:20:54.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?!\N– What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.00,0:20:55.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, sea cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.54,0:20:56.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, sea cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.91,0:21:00.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no, we left Captain Caribou on that ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.18,0:21:02.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.45,0:21:08.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, by way of greeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.19,0:21:13.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,fire the gatling gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.76,0:21:20.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kill all the Straw Hats and...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.13,0:21:24.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.55,0:21:40.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! Don't throw me out into the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.02,0:21:46.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's something you shouldn't do!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.46,0:21:50.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have to value people's life!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.23,0:21:54.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The gods... The gods are watching\Nover you! Don't you think so?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.36,0:21:57.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're being inconsistent!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.77,0:22:01.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weren't you gonna fire\Na gatling gun and kill us all?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.80,0:22:03.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, that was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.64,0:22:06.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was just a play on words.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.48,0:22:08.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That wasn't playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.04,0:22:09.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.91,0:22:12.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must be the captain of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.55,0:22:14.68,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Roronoa Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.49,0:22:19.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way! I'm not a captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.59,0:22:21.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.22,0:22:25.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was forced to be a slave for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.33,0:22:28.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sick of being on that ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.23,0:22:29.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah! This is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.93,0:22:33.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can I stay on this ship for a little while?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.30,0:22:34.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.50,0:22:38.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, he is kind of pathetic...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.17,0:22:40.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way! He just made it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.84,0:22:43.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! He just made it up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.51,0:22:47.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, where did you find the sea cow\Nwho was drawing your ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.38,0:22:49.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.79,0:22:52.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.72,0:22:54.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Cutie-san! - OG}one fine cutie!{Gab}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.06,0:22:57.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the cat burglar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.19,0:23:02.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,252)}Stop looking at our navigator like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.23,0:23:04.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami{-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.80,0:23:08.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're safe... now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.10,0:23:10.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's getting to be a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.77,0:23:15.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just caught that sea monster somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.35,0:23:21.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Experienced people\Nhave those animals pull their ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.52,0:23:22.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.79,0:23:24.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.02,0:23:28.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop, sea cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.16,0:23:29.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.79,0:23:33.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brother! I'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.86,0:23:36.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna find a sea monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.80,0:23:38.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.20,0:23:40.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.17,0:23:44.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's start his rehabilitation\Nwith some less stimulating pics.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.91,0:23:46.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.54,0:23:49.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The direction we're heading is slightly off from where log pose is pointing. - OG}We're not exactly heading\Nwhere the log pose is pointing.{Gab}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.68,0:23:51.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.81,0:23:55.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The right course should be\Nsouthwest of where it's pointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.25,0:24:00.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's faster to go straight.\NWhy should we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.12,0:24:04.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you go straight, you'd be\Ntaken away by the sea current
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.66,0:24:08.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{and get stuck by an undersea mountain or volcano. - OG}and get stuck by a volcano\Nor an undersea mountain.{Gab, better line break}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.10,0:24:10.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Volcano!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.30,0:24:11.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's scary to be in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.77,0:24:16.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I thought the sea currents\Nin the Grand Line were volatile.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.84,0:24:19.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is there any stable current?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.58,0:24:21.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.31,0:24:22.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.78,0:24:24.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.11,0:24:29.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone! It's gonna get colder from\Nhere on out so wear a coat or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.12,0:24:33.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's getting chilly. I can feel it on my skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.19,0:24:35.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.32,0:24:38.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're a skeleton so you don't have skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.30,0:24:40.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper{-san}...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.96,0:24:43.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.13,0:24:45.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't steal my line...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.84,0:24:49.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are we going somewhere cold?\NNot the deep sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.07,0:24:52.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you know that the water\Nin the deep sea is cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.64,0:24:56.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like in a bathtub, hot water goes up\Nand cold water goes down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.28,0:24:59.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah? I'm not a big fan\Nof baths so I wouldn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.12,0:25:00.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.68,0:25:04.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If the sea is the same as a bathtub,\Nit's gonna get colder as you go deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.95,0:25:07.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The temperature isn't the only difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.76,0:25:10.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're still depressed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.89,0:25:12.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the deep layer of the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.03,0:25:19.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there are giant currents called deep currents\Nthat you don't get to see very often.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.64,0:25:24.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those currents flow totally\Nindependently from surface currents.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.71,0:25:27.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are currents under currents?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.78,0:25:29.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{You know many things! - OG}You know a lot!{Gab}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.98,0:25:32.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because I'm really old!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.05,0:25:36.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All currents are connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.45,0:25:39.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One current flows eastward\Nand the other one flows westward.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.66,0:25:42.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They could also flow upward or downward.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.93,0:25:45.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's like a giant dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.49,0:25:50.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deep currents flow really slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.03,0:25:55.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once they flow to the deep sea,\Nit takes two thousand years...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.91,0:25:58.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,until they flow upward to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.74,0:26:00.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two thousand years?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.34,0:26:01.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.98,0:26:09.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}That's why there are a number of myths\Nabout the dark and undiscovered deep currents.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.59,0:26:10.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.99,0:26:12.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Curses!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.12,0:26:14.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spirits of the dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.69,0:26:15.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.79,0:26:17.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are ghosts in the deep sea?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.73,0:26:20.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Really? I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.03,0:26:21.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.40,0:26:23.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ghosts...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.53,0:26:25.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.30,0:26:30.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we're gonna get on a downward flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.61,0:26:34.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's how we get to the deep sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.88,0:26:39.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{So there are wonderful currents... - OG}– So there's mystery currents...\N– So there's mystery currents...{Gab, matching the gag in RM 01 - 07:59}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.85,0:26:42.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys didn't understand a bit, did you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.95,0:26:46.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wanna sing, Nami{-san}?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.49,0:26:47.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.46,0:26:53.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.26,0:26:55.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, I see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.10,0:26:56.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.10,0:26:57.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The wonderful current?! - OG}The mystery current?!{Gab, 26:38}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.34,0:27:00.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where is it? Where is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.77,0:27:02.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.37,0:27:05.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.37,0:27:08.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that's the downward current!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.81,0:27:10.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{The downward flow–plume! - OG}The Downwelling Current Plume!{Gab, term stolen from viz}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.21,0:27:15.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How... cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.18,0:27:18.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's like a massive...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.56,0:27:24.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,waterfall in the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.36,0:27:26.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The sea is "falling" far below!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.96,0:27:29.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At an extraordinary speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.87,0:27:31.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.77,0:27:35.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nature's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.21,0:27:38.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a spectacular stream!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.37,0:27:40.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder how deep it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.28,0:27:45.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's far greater than I had heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.92,0:27:47.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't see the bottom!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.82,0:27:49.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's completely dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.09,0:27:51.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.52,0:27:56.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With that speed, we're gonna be\Nslammed into the bottom and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.79,0:27:59.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it really okay to go with the flow?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.80,0:28:01.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.96,0:28:06.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sunny{\i0} is the strongest ship\Nbuilt from Adam, the Jewel Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.54,0:28:10.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.77,0:28:16.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that it lives here...!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.31,0:28:19.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a demon that rules the realm of water!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.82,0:28:22.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the enemy of the human race!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.72,0:28:25.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.92,0:28:27.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should turn back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.59,0:28:29.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.39,0:28:31.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I had forgotten about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.19,0:28:32.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There is a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.93,0:28:34.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.43,0:28:36.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.74,0:28:40.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Be... - OG}Is it...{Gab, would look like just the word "be" if its split but with the same wording}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.07,0:28:43.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,behind me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.55,0:28:53.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the kraken!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.78,0:28:57.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How huge! The monster octopus!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.79,0:29:00.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like he broke a lot of ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.96,0:29:03.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ships that had left for\Nthe New World have been attacked!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.19,0:29:07.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please! I don't wanna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.20,0:29:08.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.40,0:29:11.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you just wait for a few days, it would–
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.93,0:29:13.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.97,0:29:17.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have a good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.21,0:29:20.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's tame him!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.98,0:29:22.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Huh?\N– Huh?
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=11}===============================DIALOGUE============================
